    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11863" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεννέπω</span></b> , Trag. word, also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπενέπω</span></b>  (only lyr. <i><span class="en">
